    "title": "pandas.io.formats.style.Styler.set_caption — pandas 3.1.0.dev0 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "This method sets the table caption that is rendered as a <caption>\nelement in HTML output or as a \\caption command in LaTeX output.\nFor LaTeX, a tuple of two strings can be provided to specify both a\nfull caption and a short caption.\n\nParameters:\n\ncaptionstr, tuple, list\n\nFor HTML output either the string input is used or the first element of the\ntuple. For LaTeX the string input provides a caption and the additional\ntuple input allows for full captions and short captions, in that order.\n\nReturns:\n\nStyler\n\nInstance of class with text set for <caption> HTML element.",
    "markdown_length": 571,
